{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0097593","isObsolete":false,"name":"ventral disc microtubule array","definition":{"text":"A part of the ventral disc of Giardia species (trophozoite stage) consisting of a spiral array of microtubules linked to the ventral membrane. These microtubules form the base of the ventral disc dorsal microribbons that extend nearly perpendicular from the membrane."},"comment":"Due to the asymmetric nature of the Giardia trophozoite, this term is defined spatially as the trophozoite is viewed from the dorsal side, with the two nuclei dorsal to the ventral disc, and the ventral disc toward the anterior.","synonyms":[{"name":"spiral microtubule array","type":"broad"},{"name":"ventral disc spiral microtubule array","type":"exact"},{"name":"ventral disk microtubule array","type":"related"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2024-03-05","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044422 (obsolete organelle part)"},{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0110165 (cellular anatomical structure)"},{"timestamp":"2018-08-18","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"part of GO:0097597 (ventral disc)"},{"timestamp":"2017-11-08","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"has part GO:0097597 (ventral disc)"},{"timestamp":"2017-05-22","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"has part GO:0097597 (ventral disc)"},{"timestamp":"2017-04-06","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"has part GO:0097597 (ventral disc)"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"has part GO:0097592 (ventral disc overlap zone)"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"has part GO:0097597 (ventral disc)"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044422 (obsolete organelle part)"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"A part of the ventral disc of Giardia species (trophozoite stage) consisting of a spiral array of microtubules linked to the ventral membrane. These microtubules form the base of the ventral disc dorsal microribbons that extend nearly perpendicular from the membrane."},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"ventral disc spiral microtubule array"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"ventral disk microtubule array"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"spiral microtubule array"},{"timestamp":"2014-04-06","action":"Added","category":"TERM","text":"ventral disc microtubule array"}],"taxonConstraints":[{"ancestorId":"GO:0097593","ancestorName":"ventral disc microtubule array","relationship":"only_in_taxon","taxId":"5740","taxIdType":"NCBITaxon","taxName":"Giardia"}],"aspect":"cellular_component","usage":"Unrestricted","blacklist":[{"goId":"GO:0097593","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000314 from this reference: PMID:17766466","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"E2RU10","taxonId":"184922","entityName":"EB1_GIAIC","ancestorGoId":"GO:0097597"}]}],"pageInfo":null}